{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-zec-9-1","title":"Zechariah 9:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God defends his church. 9 Zion is exhorted to rejoice for the coming of Christ, and his peaceable kingdom. 12 God's promises of victory and defence.</p>\n<p>Cir. A.M. 3494. B.C. 510. burden. Isa 13:1; Jer 23:33-38; Mal 1:1 Damascus. Ge 14:15; Isa 17:1-3; Jer 49:23-27; Am 1:3-5; 3:12 the rest. 5:4; Isa 9:8-21 when. 8:21-23; 2Ch 20:12; Ps 25:15; Isa 17:7,8; 45:20-22; 52:10; Ps 145:15 Jer 16:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-2","title":"Zechariah 9:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Hamath. Nu 13:21; 2Ki 23:33; 25:21; Jer 49:23; Am 6:14 Tyrus. Isa 23:1-18; Eze 26:1-28:26; Joe 3:4-8; Am 1:9,10 Zidon. 1Ki 17:9; Eze 28:21-26; Ob 1:20 it be. Eze 28:3-5,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-3","title":"Zechariah 9:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>build. Jos 19:29; 2Sa 24:7 heaped. 1Ki 10:27; Job 22:24; 27:16; Isa 23:8; Eze 27:33; 28:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-4","title":"Zechariah 9:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the Lord. Pr 10:2; 11:4; Isa 23:1-7; Eze 28:16; Joe 3:8 he will. Eze 26:17; 27:26-36; 28:2,8 shall. Eze 28:18; Am 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-5","title":"Zechariah 9:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Ashkelon. Isa 14:29-31; Jer 47:1,4-7; Eze 25:15-17; Zep 2:4-7; Ac 8:26 and be. Jer 51:8,9; Eze 26:15-21; Re 18:9-17 for. Isa 20:5,6; Ro 5:5; Php 1:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-6","title":"Zechariah 9:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Ec 2:18-21; 6:2; Am 1:8; Isa 2:12-17; 23:9; 28:1; Da 4:37; Zep 2:10 1Pe 5:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-7","title":"Zechariah 9:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>I will. 1Sa 17:34-36; Ps 3:7; 58:6; Am 3:12 blood. Heb. bloods. he that. 8:23; Isa 11:12-14; 19:23-25; Jer 48:47; 49:6,39; Eze 16:57-61 a governor. Isa 49:22,23; 60:14-16; Ga 3:28 a Jebusite. 2Sa 24:16-23; 1Ch 11:4-6; 21:15-30; 22:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-8","title":"Zechariah 9:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>I will. 2:1-13; 12:8; Ge 32:1,2; Ps 34:7; 46:1-5; 125:1,2; Isa 4:5; 26:1; 31:5 Isa 33:20-22; 52:12; Joe 3:16,17; Re 20:9 because of him that passeth by. 2Ki 23:29; 24:1; Jer 46:2,13; Da 11:6,7,10-16,27-29,40-45 no. 14:11; Ps 72:4; Isa 52:1; 54:14; 60:18; Jer 31:12; Eze 28:24,25 Eze 39:29; Am 9:15; Re 20:1-3 for. Ex 3:7,9; 2Sa 16:12; Ac 7:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-9","title":"Zechariah 9:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Rejoice. 2:10; Ps 97:6-8; Isa 12:6; 40:9; 52:9,10; 62:11; Zep 3:14,15 behold. Ps 2:6; 45:1; 110:1-4; Isa 9:6,7; 32:1,2; Jer 23:5,6; 30:9; Mt 21:4,5 Mr 11:9,10; Lu 19:37,38; Joh 1:49; 12:13-15; 19:15 he is. Ps 45:6,7; 85:9-12; Isa 45:21; Mt 1:21; Ro 3:24-26 having salvation. or, saving himself. lowly. Mt 11:29; 21:5-7; Mr 11:7; Lu 19:30-35; Joh 12:14-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-10","title":"Zechariah 9:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>I will. Ho 1:7; 2:18; Mic 5:10,11; Hag 2:22; 2Co 10:4,5 the battle. 10:4,5 he shall. Ps 72:3,7,17; Isa 11:10; 49:6; 57:18,19; Mic 4:2-4; Ac 10:36 Ro 15:9-13; 2Co 5:18,20; Eph 2:13-17; Col 1:20,21 his dominion. Ps 2:8-12; 72:8-11; 98:1-3; Isa 9:6,7; 60:12; Mic 5:4; Re 11:15 from the river. De 11:24; 1Ki 4:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-11","title":"Zechariah 9:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>As. De 5:31; 2Sa 13:13; 2Ch 7:17; Da 2:29 by the blood of thy covenant. or, whose covenant is by blood. Ex 24:8; Mt 26:28; Mr 14:24; Lu 22:20; 1Co 11:25; Heb 9:10-26 Heb 10:29; 13:20 I have. Ps 69:33; 102:19-21; 107:10-16; Isa 42:7,22; 49:9; 51:14; 58:12 Isa 61:1; Lu 4:18; Ac 26:17,18; Col 1:13,14 out. Ps 30:3; 40:2; Jer 38:6; Lu 16:24; Re 20:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-12","title":"Zechariah 9:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Turn. Isa 52:2; Jer 31:6; 50:4,5,28; 51:10; Mic 4:8; Na 1:7; Heb 6:18 even. Isa 38:18; 49:9; Jer 31:17; La 3:21,22; Eze 37:11; Ho 2:15 I will. Job 42:10; Isa 40:2; 61:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-13","title":"Zechariah 9:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>bent. 1:21; 10:3-7; 12:2-8; Mic 5:4-9; Re 17:14 and raised. Ps 49:2-9; La 4:2; Am 2:11; Ob 1:21 against. Da 8:21-25; 11:32-34; Joe 3:6-8; Mic 4:2,3; Mr 16:15-20 Ro 15:16-20; 1Co 1:21-28; 2Co 10:3-5; 2Ti 4:7 made. 12:8; Ps 18:32-35; 45:3; 144:1; 149:6; Isa 41:15,16; 49:2; Eph 6:17 Heb 4:12; Re 1:16; 2:12; 19:15,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-14","title":"Zechariah 9:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>seen. 2:5; 12:8; 14:3; Ex 14:24,25; Jos 10:11-14,42; Mt 28:20; Ac 4:10,11 Ro 15:19; Heb 2:4 his. Ps 18:14; 45:3-5; 77:17,18; 144:5,6; Isa 30:30; Re 6:2 blow. Jos 6:4,5; Isa 18:3; 27:13; 2Co 10:4,5 whirlwinds. Isa 21:1; 66:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-15","title":"Zechariah 9:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>they shall devour. 10:5; 12:6; Mic 5:8; Re 19:13-21 subdue. 1Sa 17:45; 1Co 1:18 with sling stones. or, with the stones of the sling. shalldrink. 17; 10:7; Ps 78:65; So 1:4; 5:1; 7:9; Isa 55:1; Ac 2:13-18; Eph 5:18 filled like bowls. or, fill both the bowls, etc. 14:20 the corners. Ex 27:2; Le 4:7,18,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-16","title":"Zechariah 9:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>shall save. Ps 100:3; Isa 40:10; Jer 23:3; Eze 34:22-26,31; Mic 5:4; 7:14 Lu 12:32; Joh 10:27; 1Pe 5:2-4 as. Isa 62:3; Hag 2:23 lifted. 8:23; Isa 11:10-12; 60:3,14; Zep 3:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-9-17","title":"Zechariah 9:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>how great is his goodness. Ps 31:19; 36:7; 86:5,15; 145:7; Isa 63:7,15; Joh 3:16; Ro 5:8,20 Eph 1:7,8; 2:4,5; 3:18,19; Tit 3:4-7; 1Jo 4:8-11 how great is his beauty. Ex 15:11; Ps 45:2; 50:2; 90:17; So 5:10; Isa 33:17; Joh 1:14 2Co 4:4-6; Re 5:12-14 corn. Isa 62:8,9; 65:13,14; Ho 2:21,22; Joe 2:26; 3:18; Am 8:11-14 Am 9:13,14; Eph 5:18,19 cheerful. or, grow, or, speak. So 7:9</p>"}]}